 TRA                                       --------------------------------------------------------                        
 TRA                                       Columns   Description                                                           
 TRA                                       --------  -----------                                                           
 TRA                                         44      Family                                                                
 TRA                                                  A Incident energy                                                    
 TRA                                                  B Incident energy uncertainty                                        
 TRA                                                  E Secondary energy                                                   
 TRA                                                  G Secondary angle                                                    
 TRA                                         48      Operation flag 1 (col.48):                                            
 TRA                                                  0 No operation                                                       
 TRA                                                  1 Half of the sum of the two values                                  
 TRA                                                  2 Half of the field                                                  
 TRA                                                  3 Half of difference of the two values                               
 TRA                                         51-52   Operation flag 2 (col.51-52):                                            
 TRA                                                  1 CM incident energy to lab incident energy                          
 TRA                                                  2 Eexc of compound to lab incident energy                            
 TRA                                                  3 Momentum to energy                                                 
 TRA                                                  4 Temperature to energy                                              
 TRA                                                  5 Wave length to energy                                              
 TRA                                                  6 Q-value to Eexc                                                    
 TRA                                                  7 Cosine to angle                                                    
 TRA                                                  8 c.m momentum transfer (1/fm) to c.m. angle                         
 TRA                                                  9 c.m momentum transfer (eV/c) to c.m. angle                         
 TRA                                                 10 level number to level energy
 TRA                                         54      Reference frame (col.54):                                             
 TRA                                                  L Laboratory system                                                  
 TRA                                                  C Centre-of-mass system                                              
 TRA                                         56- 58  Field identifier (col.56-58):                                          
 TRA                                                  E2  Outgoing energy                                                  
 TRA                                                  LVL Level energy                                                     
 TRA                                                  EXC Excitation energy                                                
 TRA                                                  QVL Q-value                                                          
 TRA                                         60- 69  Heading 1                                                             
 TRA                                         71- 80  Heading 2                                                             
 TRA                                       *Note                                                                           
 TRA                                        A heading pair defined with family=A and operation 1=1                         
 TRA                                       can be also used for determination of the incident                              
 TRA                                       energy uncertainty (i.e., A+1 is equivalent to B+3)                             
